# Tab ▸ Load on Start (TabData.loadOnStart): a cold start gives the open tab a page, as always
# (cold-start-lazy-tabs), and also the tab marked Load on Start, loaded behind 2 s in
# (MainWindowController.loadTabsOnStart); the others stay out of memory until shown. Tab sleeping
# leaves it alone (TabSleepPolicy, CraCore). 10 Nov 2026.
